-- src:3049 | The Secretary may share information concerning community food projects with researchers, practitioners, and other interested parties.
@ref s 2034(g)(2)(B) Other interested parties (src:3048-3049)
`s 2034(g)(2)(B) the Secretary's permission to share information with researchers and others` MEANS
